{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>In the iniquities of their fathers they are.</b> When the iniquities of their fathers are with them — when they hold the deeds of their fathers in their hands (ibid.)." "<b>They shall waste away.</b> A term of melting away, like יִמַּסּוּ, and like it: ״תִּמַּקְנָה בְחֹרֵיהֶן״ (Zechariah 14), ״נָמַקּוּ חַבּוּרֹתָי״ (Psalms 38)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:49.525240981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}